  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "Given an array AAA of length NNN, you have to perform QQQ queries on it.\n\nThere are three different type of queries:\n\n\n111 LLL RRR - For every iii such that L≤i≤RL \\le i \\le RL≤i≤R and Ai&gt;0A_i \\gt 0Ai​&gt;0, replace AiA_iAi​ with AiA_iAi​ ∣|∣ (Ai−1)(A_i-1)(Ai​−1).\n222 LLL RRR - For every iii such that L≤i≤RL \\le i \\le RL≤i≤R and Ai&gt;0A_i \\gt 0Ai​&gt;0, replace AiA_iAi​ with AiA_iAi​ &amp;\\&amp;&amp; (Ai−1)(A_i-1)(Ai​−1).\n333 xxx - Print AxA_xAx​.\nOutput the answer to each query of type 333.\n\n\nInput Format\n\nThe first line contains 222 integers, NNN and QQQ - the number of elements in the array AAA and the number of queries, respectively.\nThe next line contains NNN integers - A1A_1A1​, A2A_2A2​, …\\ldots…, ANA_NAN​, the elements of the array AAA.\niii-th line of the next QQQ lines contains the description of the iii-th query.\n\n\nOutput Format\nFor each query of type 333, output the value of AxA_xAx​.",
    "constraints": [
      "1≤N≤2×1051 \\le N \\le 2\\times10^51≤N≤2×105",
      "1≤Q≤3×1051 \\le Q \\le 3\\times10^51≤Q≤3×105",
      "0≤Ai≤230−10 \\le A_i \\le 2^{30}-10≤Ai​≤230−1",
      "For queries of type 111 and 222, 1≤L≤R≤N1 \\le L \\le R \\le N1≤L≤R≤N",
      "For queries of type 333, 1≤x≤N1 \\le x \\le N1≤x≤N"
    ],
    "inputFormat": "",
    "outputFormat": "",
    "notes": [],
